{"end_line":2416,"fingerprint":"sha256:356d96b201ead5a92c88b632594a578d731d8591960d24920c656c2f6657eae2","heading_path":["第7章 特征值与特征向量","7.2 特征多项式","7.2.1 推导"],"id":"第7章 特征值与特征向量 / 7.2 特征多项式 / 7.2.1 推导::1::sha256:356d96b201ead5a92c88b632594a578d731d8591960d24920c656c2f6657eae2","start_line":2394,"text":"#### 7.2.1 推导\n\n我们要非零的 v 满足 $A \\cdot v = \\lambda \\cdot v$。\n$$\nAv = \\lambda v\n$$\n$$\n\\rightarrow Av - \\lambda v = 0\n$$\n$\\rightarrow Av - \\lambda I v = 0$      （$\\lambda$ 是数字，乘 I 变成矩阵）\n$$\n\\rightarrow (A - \\lambda I) \\cdot v = 0\n$$\n问题：$(A - \\lambda I) \\cdot v = 0$ 什么时候有非零解？\n由第 4-5 章的知识：$M \\cdot v = 0$ 有非零解 $\\Leftrightarrow \\det(M) = 0$。\n\n定义 7.3（特征方程 / 特征多项式）\n$$\np(\\lambda) = \\det(A - \\lambda I) = 0\n$$\n称为 A 的特征方程。$p(\\lambda)$ 是一个关于 $\\lambda$ 的 n 次多项式。它的根就是 A 的特征值。\n几何翻译：$\\det(A-\\lambda I) = 0$ 在找一个 $\\lambda$，使得变换 $A-\\lambda I$ 把某些方向\"压扁\"（行列式 $= 0 =$ 面积消失）。这些被压扁的方向上的向量，就是特征向量。"}]},"status":"draft","teaching_profile":{"minimum_level":3,"required_sections":["definition","formula","derivation","worked_examples","geometric_meaning","pitfalls","connections"],"requires_analogy_boundary":false},"topic_id":"ch07.characteristic-polynomial","visual_semantics":{"entities":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch07.characteristic-polynomial"],"dimension":2,"id":"entity.ch07.characteristic-polynomial.v","kind":"vector","label":"v","role":"vector_a","value":[1,2]},{"claim_refs":["claim.ch07.characteristic-polynomial"],"dimension":2,"id":"entity.ch07.characteristic-polynomial.result","kind":"vector","label":"result","role":"transformed_a","value":[2,4]}],"relations":[{"claim_refs":["claim.ch07.characteristic-polynomial"],"id":"relation.ch07.characteristic-polynomial.maps","kind":"maps_to","parameters":{"scalar":2},"source_ref":"entity.ch07.characteristic-polynomial.v","target_ref":"entity.ch07.characteristic-polynomial.result"}],"scene_family":"subspace_region","scene_kind":"2d","stages":[{"caption":"显示线性关系。","expected_invariants":["finite numeric result"],"